  "description": "Jeils, a country steeped in drugs and violence.  \nThe boss's second son, Sebastian Arlington, appeared to the Arlington family who ruled there.  \nIn the eyes of the organization's executive, Jesse Haley, Sebastian was just a beautiful second son - but after spending the night with him by chance, he finds out that he was a pervert psycho in the opposite direction...\n\nIn fact, Jessie, a better strategist than anyone else. A hard-boiled love story between Haley and  \nSebastian who only feels thirsty for Jessie despite his rough expressions of affection !\n\n**Official Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3093000149), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/JustLove), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/righteous_love), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9241756), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230015)",
